                            <p style="margin:0"><strong>ظپطµظٹظ„ط© ط§ظ„ط¯ظ…:</strong> <span style="color:#ef4444;font-weight:800;direction:ltr;display:inline-block">${patientData.bloodType || '-'}</span></p>
